{"seq":7,"slug":"robotic-manipulation","title":"机器人操作与抓取","stage":"DONE","category":"robotics-automation","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"机器人操作与抓取\">机器人操作与抓取</h1><p>让机器人稳稳拿起一个物体，看似日常，却要把力学、感知、规划、控制和学习全部串到一起。一只夹爪合拢的瞬间，背后是&quot;接触能否锁住物体&quot;的力学判据、&quot;物体在哪朝哪&quot;的三维感知、&quot;关节怎么动才能到那里&quot;的运动规划、&quot;接触时如何不硬碰硬&quot;的力控，以及近年来&quot;能否让机器人自己学会&quot;的数据驱动方法。这个 hub 把这五件事按一条由内到外、由经典到前沿的脉络讲清楚。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 分四章，构成层层递进的四条主线。第一章「抓取建模与力学」是地基：它回答一个最根本的问题——凭什么相信夹爪能拿稳。从力封闭与形封闭的几何—力学判据，到接触模型与摩擦锥的物理约束，再到把&quot;是否封闭&quot;细化为连续分数的抓取质量度量，这一章给出了评价任何抓取好坏的统一语言。</p>\n<p>第二章「感知与位姿估计」把抓取从理论拉进真实世界。机器人要先&quot;看见&quot;物体才能抓——从 RGB-D 相机成像与点云处理的几何底座，到模型已知时的 6D 物体位姿估计，再到面对未知物体直接预测抓取的抓取检测网络。这一章的输出，正是第一章力学判据所需的接触点位置。</p>\n<p>第三章「操作规划与控制」负责把&quot;抓哪里&quot;变成电机指令。运动学与逆运动学连接关节空间与笛卡尔空间，轨迹规划与避障生成无碰路径，力控与柔顺控制则让机器人在接触中懂得退让——从抓取走向真正的操作（装配、插拔、擦拭）。</p>\n<p>第四章「学习驱动的操作」是当下的前沿，也是全 hub 的归宿。当任务太难显式建模时，让机器人从数据里学：模仿学习从人类示范起步，强化学习在试错中超越示范，视觉-语言-动作（VLA）大模型则把前三章的所有模块端到端整合进一个能听懂自然语言的通用策略。</p>\n<p>四条主线不是孤立的。力学为感知提供评价标准，感知为规划提供目标，规划与控制为执行提供保障，而学习方法既站在前三者的肩膀上，又反过来用端到端的方式吸收它们。理解经典模块，恰恰是判断 VLA 等大模型何时可信、何时需要显式兜底的基础——这正是本 hub 从力学一路讲到大模型的用意。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"grasp-mechanics","title":"抓取建模与力学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/grasp-mechanics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"force-form-closure","title":"力封闭与形封闭","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/grasp-mechanics/force-form-closure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contact-friction-models","title":"接触模型与摩擦锥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/grasp-mechanics/contact-friction-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grasp-quality-metrics","title":"抓取质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/grasp-mechanics/grasp-quality-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"perception-pose","title":"感知与位姿估计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rgbd-pointcloud","title":"RGB-D 与点云处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/rgbd-pointcloud"},{"seq":2,"slug":"6d-pose-estimation","title":"6D 物体位姿估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/6d-pose-estimation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"grasp-detection-networks","title":"抓取检测网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/perception-pose/grasp-detection-networks"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"planning-control","title":"操作规划与控制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kinematics-ik","title":"运动学与逆运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/kinematics-ik"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trajectory-planning","title":"轨迹规划与避障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/trajectory-planning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"force-compliant-control","title":"力控与柔顺控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/force-compliant-control"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"learning-manipulation","title":"学习驱动的操作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"imitation-learning","title":"模仿学习与示教","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/imitation-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rl-grasping","title":"强化学习抓取策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/rl-grasping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vla-models","title":"视觉-语言-动作模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/vla-models"}]}]}